What can be inferred about "algorithmic management" from the third paragraph?', 'It ensures absolute fairness by eliminating human bias from performance evaluations.', 'It empowers workers to negotiate their pay rates directly with customers in real time.', 'It subjects workers to strict, opaque control while stripping them of procedural justice.', 'It automatically rewards workers with bonuses whenever they reject unprofitable tasks.', 'It requires human managers to manually review every customer complaint before penalizing workers.', 'C', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 3 menjelaskan bahwa algoritme mengontrol tarif dan menonaktifkan akun secara sepihak berdasarkan model data yang tidak transparan (opaque) tanpa adanya jalur banding manusia (without any avenue for human appeal / hilangnya keadilan prosedural).
Perbandingan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Algoritme justru menciptakan dinamika kekuasaan yang timpang (asymmetric), bukan keadilan absolut.
(B) Salah: Pekerja tidak bisa menegosiasikan tarif secara langsung dengan pelanggan.
(D) Salah: Menolak pesanan murah justru berisiko membuat akun dinonaktifkan, bukan mendapat bonus.
(E) Salah: Sistem berjalan otomatis tanpa tinjauan manajer manusia.', true),
