According to the fourth paragraph, what is the primary goal of recent legislative efforts regarding the gig economy?', 'To completely ban mobile applications that rely on independent contractors for delivery services.', 'To force all gig workers to transition into rigid, forty-hour-per-week corporate schedules.', 'To create a hybrid worker classification that combines schedule autonomy with basic protections.', 'To transfer the ownership of digital labor platforms directly to international labor unions.', 'To eliminate algorithmic tracking systems from all smartphone-based freelance platforms.', 'C', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 4 menyebutkan legislasi baru bertujuan menciptakan kategori pekerjaan ketiga (third category) yang mempertahankan fleksibilitas jadwal sekaligus mewajibkan jaring pengaman sosial dasar (mandating basic social safety nets).
