According to the first paragraph, what distinguishes green hydrogen from gray hydrogen?', 'Green hydrogen is extracted directly from underground natural gas reserves without refining.', 'Green hydrogen is produced via renewable-powered water electrolysis without carbon emissions.', 'Green hydrogen releases oxygen as a harmful greenhouse gas during the combustion process.', 'Green hydrogen relies on nuclear fission rather than solar or wind energy to split molecules.', 'Green hydrogen is a naturally occurring gas found abundantly in the Earth''s upper atmosphere.', 'B', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 1 menegaskan bahwa green hydrogen dihasilkan melalui elektrolisis air yang ditenagai energi terbarukan (angin dan surya) tanpa menghasilkan emisi gas rumah kaca (leaving zero greenhouse gas emissions behind).
