Why is green hydrogen considered superior to lithium-ion batteries for industries like aviation and steel manufacturing, as mentioned in the second paragraph?', 'Lithium-ion batteries are completely non-recyclable and banned in international shipping.', 'Green hydrogen offers the high energy density required by heavy industries that batteries cannot match.', 'Electrolyzers are much cheaper to install in airplanes than conventional electric motors.', 'Steel manufacturing requires oxygen byproducts that only lithium-ion batteries can generate.', 'Aviation companies have already replaced all jet fuel with green hydrogen globally.', 'B', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 2 menyebutkan bahwa penerbangan jarak jauh, perkapalan, dan manufaktur baja membutuhkan kepadatan energi sangat tinggi (immense energy density) yang secara ekonomis tidak mampu dipenuhi oleh baterai litium-ion saat ini.
