What can be inferred from the fourth paragraph about the future of green hydrogen?', 'It will immediately replace all fossil fuels in residential homes by next year.', 'Its financial viability is heavily dependent on falling renewable energy costs and technological innovation.', 'Private investors are withdrawing their funding due to the irreparable flaws of electrolyzers.', 'Governments plan to abandon solar and wind projects to focus exclusively on hydrogen.', 'The price gap between green and gray hydrogen will widen further over the next decade.', 'B', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 4 menyimpulkan bahwa kemajuan efisiensi elektroliser serta penurunan biaya tenaga surya dan angin diharapkan dapat mempersempit selisih harga dalam satu dekade ke depan, sehingga hidrogen hijau menjadi layak secara ekonomi.
Perbandingan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Klaim akan menggantikan seluruh bahan bakar fosil rumah tangga tahun depan terlalu berlebihan (overclaim).
