How do modern social media creators strengthen the illusion of friendship, as explained in the second paragraph?', 'By meeting every single one of their followers in person at organized fan conventions.', 'By refusing to accept commercial sponsorships that might alienate their loyal viewers.', 'By using intimate communication styles, live streams, and personal storytelling that mimic real bonding.', 'By restricting their content solely to scripted, high-budget television broadcasts.', 'By allowing followers to co-edit and publish videos directly onto the influencer''s main channel.', 'C', 'Alasan Benar: Paragraf 2 menjelaskan bahwa kreator menciptakan ilusi persahabatan melalui live stream, fitur pesan langsung, vlog keseharian, penggunaan kata ganti orang kedua (seolah menyapa langsung), serta berbagi cerita pribadi yang rentan (vulnerable personal stories).
Perbandingan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Kreator tidak menemui setiap pengikutnya secara langsung di konvensi.
(B) Salah: Paragraf 3 justru menyebut kreator sering memonetisasi kedekatan ini lewat sponsor.
(D) Salah: Media sosial justru melampaui era televisi yang kaku dan penuh naskah.
(E) Salah: Pengikut tidak diberi akses mengedit kanal utama kreator.', true),
