Based on the third paragraph, how does the commercial aspect of parasocial relationships affect followers?', 'Followers receive financial dividends whenever an influencer promotes a sponsored product.', 'The illusion of trust makes followers more susceptible to buying endorsed products impulsively.', 'Followers generally boycott influencers who attempt to monetize their personal stories.', 'Sponsored endorsements help socially isolated individuals build genuine real-world friendships.', 'Commercialized content permanently cures the loneliness caused by social withdrawal.', 'B', 'Alasan Benar: Kalimat terakhir paragraf 3 menyatakan: "this perceived intimacy is frequently monetized by influencers to drive impulsive consumer behavior through sponsored endorsements" (keintiman semu ini dimanfaatkan kreator untuk mendorong perilaku belanja impulsif lewat iklan sponsor).
