Based on the fourth paragraph, what can be concluded about the outcome of Aris''s collaboration with Pak Tua?', 'Aris decided to quit his career as a marine biologist and become a traditional fisherman.', 'The bay''s ecosystem recovered because the new restoration method worked in harmony with natural currents.', 'Volcanic boulders completely prevented any monsoon storms from ever entering Pulau Merah again.', 'Pak Tua took over the laboratory funding to build more steel frames in deeper waters.', 'The coral fragments grew faster solely because Aris increased the voltage of his underwater sensors.', 'B', 'The bay''s ecosystem recovered because the new restoration method worked in harmony with natural currents.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Di Paragraf 4 dijelaskan bahwa Aris memetakan jalur arus alami dan menggunakan batu vulkanik berpori di zona terlindung, sehingga kehidupan laut kembali pulih dalam setahun.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Aris tetap menjadi ahli biologi kelautan, ia hanya mengubah desain restorasinya.
(C) Salah: Batu vulkanik hanya mengarahkan arus lokal secara alami, bukan menghentikan badai monsun.
(D) Salah: Pak Tua tidak mengambil alih dana laboratorium maupun membuat rangka baja.
(E) Salah: Aris justru meninggalkan penggunaan rangka baja berarus listrik tersebut.', true),
