What is the moral lesson that can be drawn from the fourth paragraph of the story?', 'Scientific data is always unreliable when applied to tropical marine environments.', 'True progress in solving environmental problems requires humility and respect for local ecological knowledge.', 'Protecting coral reefs is the sole responsibility of elderly fishermen rather than researchers.', 'Modern technology should never be used in areas where traditional communities live.', 'Failure in scientific experiments can only be avoided by working completely alone.', 'B', 'True progress in solving environmental problems requires humility and respect for local ecological knowledge.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Moral story (pesan moral) tergambar jelas pada kalimat terakhir Paragraf 4: restorasi ekologi berhasil dengan baik ketika sains modern mau mendengarkan kearifan lingkungan masyarakat adat/lokal.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Terlalu ekstrem; data ilmiah tetap berguna jika dipadukan dengan pengetahuan lokal.
(C) Salah: Konservasi adalah tanggung jawab bersama, bukan hanya nelayan tua.
(D) Salah: Teks tidak melarang teknologi modern, melainkan menganjurkan sinergi.
(E) Salah: Justru bekerja sendiri membuat Aris gagal; kolaborasi yang membuatnya berhasil.', true),
