Which universal theme is most relevant to the entire passage?', 'The destructive impact of commercial fishing on marine biodiversity.', 'The synergy between modern scientific innovation and traditional wisdom.', 'The inevitability of natural disasters in coastal communities.', 'The rivalry between younger generations and elderly community leaders.', 'The financial cost of conducting marine research in remote islands.', 'B', 'The synergy between modern scientific innovation and traditional wisdom.
