What can be concluded from the fourth paragraph regarding Ibu Sari''s perspective at the end of the story?', 'She decided to buy printing machines to double her production speed for future exhibitions.', 'She realized that communicating the authentic story behind her craft makes tradition relevant to modern audiences.', 'She regretted allowing Dimas to document her secret botanical dyeing techniques online.', 'She planned to close her workshop permanently after selling her final collection to collectors.', 'She believed that young people would never truly understand the philosophy of ancient motifs.', 'B', 'She realized that communicating the authentic story behind her craft makes tradition relevant to modern audiences.
