Based on the second paragraph, why does automatic enrollment significantly increase participation in pension plans?', 'Because employees are fined heavily if they attempt to opt out of the program.', 'Because people tend to stick with default options due to inertia and status quo bias.', 'Because pension plans guarantee instant financial returns within the first month.', 'Because human resource managers force workers to sign contracts without reading them.', 'Because active sign-up systems are illegal in most developed countries.', 'B', 'Because people tend to stick with default options due to inertia and status quo bias.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Paragraf 2 menyebutkan bahwa pendaftaran otomatis meningkatkan partisipasi secara drastis karena adanya inersia manusia (human inertia) dan bias status quo (status quo bias), yaitu kecenderungan bertahan pada pilihan bawaan.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Karyawan tetap bebas keluar (opt out) tanpa denda.
(C) Salah: Tidak ada jaminan imbal hasil instan dalam satu bulan.
(D) Salah: Tidak ada paksaan menandatangani kontrak tanpa membaca.
(E) Salah: Sistem pendaftaran aktif tidak ilegal, hanya tingkat partisipasinya lebih rendah.', true),
