What is the implied main idea of the entire passage?', 'International maritime laws must be abolished to allow developing nations access to deep-sea fisheries.', 'Modern submersible technology has solved the mystery of how deep-sea creatures survive extreme pressure.', 'Preserving the ocean''s newly understood twilight zone from unregulated fishing is crucial for planetary health.', 'Commercial aquaculture is the leading cause of coral reef destruction in international waters.', 'Scientists have concluded that deep-sea organisms no longer need to migrate to the surface for food.', 'C', 'Preserving the ocean''s newly understood twilight zone from unregulated fishing is crucial for planetary health.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Merangkum keseluruhan teks (Paragraf 1–4): pentingnya ekosistem zona senja bagi iklim (Paragraf 1–2), ancaman penangkapan ikan komersial (Paragraf 3), dan urgensi perlindungan/regulasi demi stabilitas iklim Bumi (Paragraf 4).
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Teks justru menyerukan regulasi dan moratorium di perairan internasional, bukan menghapus hukum maritim.
(B) Salah: Terlalu sempit; hanya menyinggung teknologi kapal selam di Paragraf 1.
(D) Salah: Teks membahas ancaman terhadap zona laut dalam, bukan kerusakan terumbu karang.
(E) Salah: Bertentangan dengan fakta bahwa makhluk laut dalam bermigrasi setiap malam ke permukaan.', true),
