Which statement best captures the implied main idea of the second paragraph?', 'Paris and Seoul have completely banned private car ownership within their city limits.', 'The 15-minute city model restructures neighborhoods to prioritize local accessibility, sustainability, and community connection.', 'Urban residents prefer commuting long distances to work rather than living near local schools and parks.', 'Bike lanes are only effective in European cities with flat terrain and mild weather conditions.', 'Decentralizing urban services increases carbon emissions by forcing delivery trucks to travel further.', 'B', 'The 15-minute city model restructures neighborhoods to prioritize local accessibility, sustainability, and community connection.
