Which of the following best restates the sentence "Embracing these time-tested biological strategies allows humanity to build resilient technologies that harmonize with, rather than deplete, the natural world." in the fourth paragraph?', 'Adopting ancient biological methods forces humans to deplete natural resources in order to protect fragile technologies.', 'Utilizing proven natural designs enables people to create durable technologies that coexist peacefully with the environment instead of exhausting it.', 'Resilient technologies can only survive if humanity stops relying on biological strategies and isolates itself from nature.', 'Time-tested biological strategies are too slow to help humanity build modern technologies without harming the environment.', 'Harmonizing with the natural world requires abandoning resilient technologies in favor of primitive biological tools.', 'B', 'Utilizing proven natural designs enables people to create durable technologies that coexist peacefully with the environment instead of exhausting it.
