Which conclusion is best supported by the fourth paragraph?', 'Solar farms and wind arrays will be completely dismantled once EGS becomes commercially available.', 'Expanding EGS could help countries meet clean energy goals while preserving land for farming and nature.', 'Agricultural land is the best location for building massive wind turbine arrays alongside geothermal plants.', 'Geothermal facilities require more surface land per megawatt than any other renewable energy technology.', 'Global decarbonization is impossible unless nations sacrifice their natural forests for energy infrastructure.', 'B', 'Expanding EGS could help countries meet clean energy goals while preserving land for farming and nature.
