Which of the following best restates the sentence "Nevertheless, cybersecurity experts warn that delaying this transition could allow malicious actors to harvest encrypted data today with the intention of decrypting it once functional quantum computers become commercially available." in the fourth paragraph?', 'Security specialists caution that postponing this upgrade might enable cybercriminals to collect protected data now and unlock it later when practical quantum machines enter the market.', 'Cybersecurity experts believe malicious actors have already used commercial quantum computers to decrypt all banking records worldwide.', 'Postponing the transition to post-quantum security prevents hackers from harvesting encrypted data stored on corporate servers.', 'Malicious actors are helping cybersecurity experts accelerate the commercial availability of functional quantum computers.', 'Cybercriminals have no interest in harvesting encrypted data today because quantum computers will never become commercially viable.', 'A', 'Security specialists caution that postponing this upgrade might enable cybercriminals to collect protected data now and unlock it later when practical quantum machines enter the market.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Padanan kata tepat sasaran: "warn that delaying this transition" $\rightarrow$ "caution that postponing this upgrade", "harvest encrypted data today" $\rightarrow$ "collect protected data now", dan "decrypting it once functional quantum computers become commercially available" $\rightarrow$ "unlock it later when practical quantum machines enter the market".
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(B) Salah: Peretas baru mengumpulkan data sekarang untuk dibuka di masa depan saat komputer kuantum tersedia secara komersial.
