Which of the following best restates the sentence "While antibiotics remain indispensable for treating severe bacterial infections, their indiscriminate overuse wipes out beneficial gut flora alongside harmful pathogens, underscoring the need for targeted medical prescriptions and fiber-rich nutrition." in the fourth paragraph?', 'Antibiotics are no longer necessary for curing serious bacterial infections because fiber-rich diets kill all harmful pathogens.', 'Although antibiotics are essential for fighting serious bacterial illnesses, excessive and careless use destroys helpful gut bacteria together with disease-causing germs, highlighting the importance of precise prescriptions and high-fiber diets.', 'Indiscriminate use of antibiotics selectively eliminates harmful pathogens while leaving beneficial gut flora completely unharmed.', 'Targeted medical prescriptions are designed to wipe out beneficial gut flora so that antibiotics can work more effectively.', 'Severe bacterial infections are caused by eating fiber-rich foods while taking targeted medical prescriptions.', 'B', 'Although antibiotics are essential for fighting serious bacterial illnesses, excessive and careless use destroys helpful gut bacteria together with disease-causing germs, highlighting the importance of precise prescriptions and high-fiber diets.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Seluruh unsur kalimat terwakili: "indispensable for treating severe bacterial infections" $\rightarrow$ "essential for fighting serious bacterial illnesses", "indiscriminate overuse wipes out beneficial gut flora alongside harmful pathogens" $\rightarrow$ "excessive and careless use destroys helpful gut bacteria together with disease-causing germs", dan "targeted medical prescriptions and fiber-rich nutrition" $\rightarrow$ "precise prescriptions and high-fiber diets".
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Antibiotik tetap sangat diperlukan (indispensable) untuk infeksi bakteri berat.
(C) Salah: Penggunaan antibiotik secara sembarangan justru ikut memusnahkan bakteri baik (beneficial gut flora), bukan selektif.
(D) Salah: Resep medis yang tepat sasaran bertujuan meminimalkan kerusakan pada flora usus yang baik.
(E) Salah: Infeksi bakteri berat tidak disebabkan oleh konsumsi makanan kaya serat.', true),
