Which of the following best restates the sentence "Realizing that physical restoration alone could not halt the geological weathering of the limestone walls, Dr. Hendra initiated an urgent digital preservation project." in the second paragraph?', 'Because physical repairs by themselves were unable to stop the natural rock erosion of the caverns, Dr. Hendra launched a pressing digital archiving effort.', 'Dr. Hendra canceled the digital preservation project after discovering that physical restoration completely stopped limestone weathering.', 'Geological weathering of limestone walls can only be halted by applying physical paint layers over prehistoric pigments.', 'Believing that digital preservation was unnecessary, Dr. Hendra relied exclusively on physical restoration to protect the caves.', 'The urgent digital preservation project caused rapid geological weathering across the limestone cavern walls.', 'A', 'Because physical repairs by themselves were unable to stop the natural rock erosion of the caverns, Dr. Hendra launched a pressing digital archiving effort.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: "Realizing that physical restoration alone could not halt the geological weathering" $\rightarrow$ "Because physical repairs by themselves were unable to stop the natural rock erosion", dan "initiated an urgent digital preservation project" $\rightarrow$ "launched a pressing digital archiving effort".
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(B) Salah: Proyek digital justru diluncurkan, bukan dibatalkan.
(C) Salah: Teks tidak menyebutkan pelapisan cat fisik di atas pigmen prasejarah.
(D) Salah: Dr. Hendra menyadari restorasi fisik saja tidak cukup, sehingga ia memulai proyek digital.
(E) Salah: Pelapukan geologis disebabkan perubahan iklim, bukan oleh pemindaian laser proyek digital.', true),
