Which of the following best restates the sentence "Now, students, scholars, and global museum visitors can explore interactive virtual reconstructions of the caves without placing fragile prehistoric surfaces at risk." in the third paragraph?', 'Today, learners, academics, and international museum guests can experience digital 3D versions of the caverns safely without endangering delicate ancient walls.', 'Interactive virtual reconstructions have replaced physical museums, forcing students and scholars to visit the fragile caves in person.', 'Fragile prehistoric surfaces are now placed at greater risk whenever global museum visitors explore virtual cave reconstructions.', 'Only specialized scholars are permitted to view the interactive virtual reconstructions due to the fragility of the prehistoric surfaces.', 'Students and visitors must sign waivers accepting the risk of damaging prehistoric walls before using virtual reconstructions.', 'A', 'Today, learners, academics, and international museum guests can experience digital 3D versions of the caverns safely without endangering delicate ancient walls.
