Based on Paragraph 1 of Text 1 and Paragraph 2 of Text 2, how does moving away from traditional offshoring affect consumers?', 'It guarantees lower prices for everyday goods by eliminating international shipping tariffs.', 'It tends to increase consumer prices because manufacturing in higher-cost regions raises production expenses.', 'It allows consumers in developing economies to buy semiconductors at half their original price.', 'It eliminates inflation completely by encouraging companies to build duplicate factories.', 'It reduces consumer access to basic pharmaceuticals by banning all international trade.', 'B', 'It tends to increase consumer prices because manufacturing in higher-cost regions raises production expenses.
