According to Paragraph 2 of Text 2, what is a deceptive aspect of chronic sleep restriction?', 'People who sleep less than six hours always realize their reaction times are severely impaired.', 'Sleep-deprived individuals often feel accustomed to limited sleep even though their objective cognitive performance continues to decline.', 'Sleeping extra hours on weekends completely erases all metabolic damage caused during the workweek.', 'Mild alcohol intoxication improves attention tests compared to regular sleep patterns.', 'Melatonin supplements can permanently replace the biological need for slow-wave sleep.', 'B', 'Sleep-deprived individuals often feel accustomed to limited sleep even though their objective cognitive performance continues to decline.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Fakta tersurat pada Paragraf 2 Text 2: subjek penelitian merasa sudah beradaptasi dengan tidur minim, padahal tes objektif waktu reaksi dan perhatian menunjukkan penurunan setara keracunan alkohol ringan.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A) Salah: Penderita kurang tidur kronis justru kehilangan kemampuan menyadari penurunan kognitif mereka sendiri.
(C) Salah: Tidur balas dendam di akhir pekan (catch up on lost sleep) gagal memulihkan disregulasi metabolik sepenuhnya.
(D) Salah: Keracunan alkohol ringan dijadikan pembanding tingkat penurunan fokus, bukan sesuatu yang meningkatkan perhatian.
(E) Salah: Suplemen melatonin tidak disebut dapat menggantikan kebutuhan biologis tidur.', true),
