Based on Paragraph 2 of Text 1, why is "synaptic pruning" important during sleep?', 'It prevents the brain from exceeding its energy capacity by weakening unimportant neural connections while preserving key memories.', 'It stops the hippocampus from receiving any new information during waking hours.', 'It eliminates cerebrospinal fluid so that the neocortex can shrink overnight.', 'It replaces human neurons with artificial blue-light receptors.', 'It ensures that short-term memories are erased before they can be stored long-term.', 'A', 'It prevents the brain from exceeding its energy capacity by weakening unimportant neural connections while preserving key memories.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Dijelaskan secara eksplisit pada Paragraf 2 Text 1: koneksi saraf baru sepanjang hari dapat membebani kapasitas energi otak jika dibiarkan, sehingga saat tidur otak melemahkan sinapsis yang sepele (trivial synapses) sambil memperkuat memori penting.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(B), (C), (D), dan (E) Salah: Semuanya bertentangan dengan isi teks (hipokampus tetap menerima informasi saat terjaga; cairan serebrospinal dipompa untuk membersihkan racun, bukan dihilangkan; neuron tidak diganti reseptor cahaya biru; dan memori penting justru disimpan untuk jangka panjang).', true),
