Based on Text 1 and Paragraph 1 of Text 2, where do the two passages directly disagree?', 'On whether standardized exams are administered under uniform testing conditions.', 'On whether standardized test scores accurately reflect equal opportunity and individual merit rather than financial privilege.', 'On whether universities use standardized assessments during the admissions process.', 'On whether experienced instructors work in wealthy school districts.', 'On whether students from modest backgrounds desire upward social mobility.', 'B', 'On whether standardized test scores accurately reflect equal opportunity and individual merit rather than financial privilege.
