Which word best describes the author’s tone in the second and third paragraphs?', 'Euphoric and celebratory', 'Skeptical and analytical', 'Indifferent and detached', 'Nostalgic and sentimental', 'Hostile and insulting', 'B', 'Skeptical and analytical
