How can the author’s attitude toward the widespread adoption of noise-canceling headphones in public be characterized?', 'Uncritically enthusiastic', 'Thoughtfully concerned and cautionary', 'Bitterly sarcastic', 'Completely neutral', 'Deeply amused', 'B', 'Thoughtfully concerned and cautionary
