Which of the following pairs correctly distinguishes a FACT from an OPINION in the passage?', 'Fact: Shorter workweeks are the most humane path forward. | Opinion: The UK trial involved 61 companies.', 'Fact: Employee burnout dropped by 71 percent during the six-month UK trial. | Opinion: Generalizing a short-term trial to an entire national economy is overly optimistic.', 'Fact: Governments must resist statutory mandates. | Opinion: Participating organizations maintained 100 percent of regular pay.', 'Fact: The five-day workweek is an outdated relic. | Opinion: Sick days fell by 65 percent during the study.', 'Fact: Rigid mandates will destroy all hospitality businesses. | Opinion: Approximately 2,900 employees participated in the UK pilot.', 'B', 'Fact: Employee burnout dropped by 71 percent during the six-month UK trial. | Opinion: Generalizing a short-term trial to an entire national economy is overly optimistic.
