Which statement in the second paragraph is presented as a scientific FACT rather than an unproven claim?', 'Microplastics are proven to be the primary cause of heart attacks in young adults.', 'Epidemiological data currently available is already sufficient to predict exact human disease thresholds.', 'Laboratory experiments on cell cultures indicate that high concentrations of nanoplastics can trigger oxidative stress.', 'Toxicologists believe that plastic pollution poses no threat to human health whatsoever.', 'Petri-dish dosages are identical to the daily plastic intake of average consumers.', 'C', 'Laboratory experiments on cell cultures indicate that high concentrations of nanoplastics can trigger oxidative stress.
