Which statement in the second paragraph reflects an OPINION held by supporters of smartphone bans?', 'Magnetic pouches are used by some schools to store student devices during classes.', 'Smartphones are inherently addictive distraction machines that hijack adolescent attention.', 'Cyberbullying involves harassment conducted through digital communication platforms.', 'School hours typically span from morning until afternoon.', 'Teenagers interact with peers both online and in person.', 'B', 'Smartphones are inherently addictive distraction machines that hijack adolescent attention.
