Which of the following statements is FALSE based on the second paragraph?', 'Fungi provide host trees with soil nutrients like phosphorus and nitrogen.', 'Trees share up to 30 percent of their photosynthesized sugars with mycorrhizal fungi.', 'Mature hub trees can transmit chemical warning signals to younger seedlings via fungal networks.', 'Plant roots can easily access microscopic soil pores without any assistance from fungi.', 'Mycorrhizal connections enhance forest recovery and resistance to dry conditions.', 'D', 'Plant roots can easily access microscopic soil pores without any assistance from fungi.
