Which statement accurately reflects the exchange between trees and fungi described in the second paragraph?', 'Fungi supply carbon-rich sugars while trees absorb phosphorus from microscopic soil pores.', 'Trees provide photosynthesized sugars in return for water and soil minerals delivered by fungi.', 'Mature trees drain all nutrients from shaded seedlings to survive severe droughts.', 'Both trees and fungi rely on petrochemical fertilizers to maintain mycorrhizal networks.', 'Fungi prevent trees from performing photosynthesis during the summer months.', 'B', 'Trees provide photosynthesized sugars in return for water and soil minerals delivered by fungi.
