Based on the entire passage, which statement is TRUE?', 'Fewer than 150,000 fungal species have been formally cataloged by scientists so far.', 'Mycelium composites are made by melting petroleum plastics with forest soil.', 'Fungi can survive without organic nutrients because they generate energy from sunlight.', 'Shaded seedlings never receive carbon support from older trees in a forest.', 'Biodegradable fungal packaging takes years of industrial heat treatment to solidify.', 'A', 'Fewer than 150,000 fungal species have been formally cataloged by scientists so far.
