Which of the following statements is FALSE based on the second paragraph?', 'The VOC took control of the Banda Islands in 1621 using military force.', 'Most of the native Bandanese population was killed or displaced during the VOC conquest.', 'The Dutch divided the conquered territory into plantation estates worked by enslaved labor.', 'Captain Nathaniel Courthope surrendered Pulau Run to the VOC immediately in 1621 without resistance.', 'English presence on Pulau Run fueled prolonged rivalry between England and the Netherlands.', 'D', 'Captain Nathaniel Courthope surrendered Pulau Run to the VOC immediately in 1621 without resistance.
