According to the third paragraph, which statement is TRUE regarding the Treaty of Breda in 1667?', 'The Netherlands traded Manhattan Island to England in exchange for Pulau Run.', 'England gained permanent control over all nutmeg plantations in the Maluku Islands.', 'The treaty was signed before the outbreak of the Second Anglo-Dutch War.', 'French botanists were granted exclusive trading rights to New York City.', 'The treaty permanently prevented nutmeg from ever being grown outside Indonesia.', 'A', 'The Netherlands traded Manhattan Island to England in exchange for Pulau Run.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Sesuai dengan kalimat kedua Paragraf 3: melalui Perjanjian Breda 1667, Inggris menyerahkan klaim atas Pulau Run kepada Belanda dengan imbalan pengakuan Belanda atas kendali Inggris di Pulau Manhattan (yang kelak menjadi New York City).
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
