Which of the following statements is FALSE based on the second paragraph?', 'Highly skilled individuals often underestimate how well they perform compared to others.', 'The "false consensus effect" leads experts to assume that tasks easy for them are also easy for peers.', 'Genuine experts usually feel absolute certainty because they believe they know everything in their field.', 'Novices often feel overly confident due to a shallow understanding of a topic.', 'Deep expertise makes specialists aware of the remaining complexities in their domain.', 'C', 'Genuine experts usually feel absolute certainty because they believe they know everything in their field.
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Pernyataan ini SALAH (FALSE) karena pada kalimat terakhir Paragraf 2 dijelaskan bahwa para ahli sejati justru cenderung menunjukkan keraguan diri yang hati-hati (cautious self-doubt) karena pengetahuan mendalam membuat mereka sadar betapa luas kompleksitas yang belum mereka kuasai.
Perbandingan dengan Opsi Lain:
(A), (B), (D), dan (E) Salah (Pernyataan Benar): Semuanya sesuai dengan Paragraf 2 (orang berkompetensi tinggi sering meremehkan kemampuan relatifnya; false consensus effect membuat ahli mengira tugas mudah baginya juga mudah bagi orang lain; pemula terlalu percaya diri karena pemahaman dangkal; dan keahlian mendalam menyadarkan akan kompleksitas bidang tersebut).', true),
