In the third paragraph, the phrase "this approach" refers to...', 'Selective breeding and outplanting of heat-tolerant coral strains', 'Curbing global carbon emissions worldwide', 'Expelling symbiotic algae during thermal stress', 'Causing widespread mortality in degraded reefs', 'Measuring sea surface temperatures in Australia', 'A', 'Selective breeding and outplanting of heat-tolerant coral strains
Alasan Jawaban Benar: Pada kalimat terakhir Paragraf 3, frasa "this approach" merangkum metode ilmiah (assisted evolution) yang baru saja dijelaskan pada kalimat sebelumnya, yaitu pembiakan selektif dan penanaman kembali galur karang tahan panas (selective breeding and outplanting of heat-tolerant coral strains).
