Based on the whole passage, which brief abstract would best introduce this article in a science journal?', 'A historical review of how petroleum companies developed polyethylene terephthalate in the twentieth century.', 'An analysis of how engineered bacterial enzymes overcome the limits of mechanical recycling by converting PET waste back into virgin-quality monomers.', 'A warning that mutant bacteria could escape from recycling facilities and destroy active food packaging worldwide.', 'A comparison between glass manufacturing and synthetic textile production in East Asia.', 'A technical manual for building industrial landfills capable of containing marine plastic waste.', 'B', 'An analysis of how engineered bacterial enzymes overcome the limits of mechanical recycling by converting PET waste back into virgin-quality monomers.
