How does the second paragraph relate to the first paragraph?', 'It refutes the claim in the first paragraph that natural designs are more energy-efficient than synthetic ones.', 'It provides a specific real-world engineering case study that illustrates the general concept of biomimicry introduced in the first paragraph.', 'It shifts the discussion from living organisms to the chemical composition of toxic industrial waste.', 'It argues that kingfisher birds are less aerodynamic than early twentieth-century bullet trains.', 'It explains why evolution takes billions of years to produce simple mechanical tools.', 'B', 'It provides a specific real-world engineering case study that illustrates the general concept of biomimicry introduced in the first paragraph.
