How does the second paragraph connect to the first paragraph?', 'It defends the passive lecture model against the criticisms raised in the first paragraph.', 'It introduces "active learning" as a pedagogical solution to the low retention problems of passive lectures outlined in the first paragraph.', 'It explains why medieval universities banned students from asking questions during lectures.', 'It proves that transcribing notes silently is the fastest way to strengthen neural pathways.', 'It shifts the focus from university classrooms to elementary school playground activities.', 'B', 'It introduces "active learning" as a pedagogical solution to the low retention problems of passive lectures outlined in the first paragraph.
