What is the function of the fourth paragraph in relation to the entire passage?', 'To introduce a new historical debate about the fall of the Mesopotamian empire.', 'To synthesize the historical evidence into a broader conceptual conclusion about the true nature of money.', 'To recommend returning to clay-tablet ledgers instead of using modern bank accounts.', 'To contradict the third paragraph by claiming governments play no role in currency systems.', 'To list the names of famous classical economists who wrote introductory textbooks.', 'B', 'To synthesize the historical evidence into a broader conceptual conclusion about the true nature of money.
