Which statement is UNSTATED in the passage regarding the scientific study of subglacial lakes?', 'Subglacial lakes serve as Earth-based models for studying icy moons like Europa and Enceladus.', 'Sterile drilling procedures are necessary to prevent biological contamination of isolated habitats.', 'Microbial DNA found above Lake Vostok includes bacteria, archaea, and microscopic fungi.', 'Grinding glacial movement scrapes minerals from the bedrock into the lake water.', 'Astronauts have already landed on Enceladus to drill through its icy crust.', 'E', 'Astronauts have already landed on Enceladus to drill through its icy crust.
