Based on the first and second paragraphs, which of the following statements is TRUE (Stated)?', 'Subglacial food webs depend entirely on seasonal sunlight during the Antarctic summer.', 'Lake Vostok is roughly comparable in surface area to Lake Ontario.', 'Oligotrophic environments are characterized by abundant organic food sources.', 'Crushing hydrostatic pressure prevents any bacteria from surviving beneath four kilometers of ice.', 'Subglacial microbes obtain energy by digesting fallen leaves from ancient forests.', 'B', 'Lake Vostok is roughly comparable in surface area to Lake Ontario.
