Which statement is UNSTATED in the passage?', 'One indigenous language becomes extinct roughly every few weeks.', 'Australian Aboriginal languages contain detailed classifications for local species.', 'Grassroots movements are working alongside UNESCO to revive endangered tongues.', 'Māori immersion preschools pair fluent elders with young learners.', 'UNESCO has successfully restored every single endangered language on Earth to full fluency.', 'E', 'UNESCO has successfully restored every single endangered language on Earth to full fluency.
